    "h1": "HTS Chapter 12: Oil Seeds and Oleaginous Fruits; Miscellaneous Grains, Seeds and Fruit; Industrial or Medicinal Plants; Straw and Fodder — U.S. Exports & Foreign Tariffs",
    "seo": {
      "title": "Chapter 12 Exports: U.S. Soybeans & Oilseed Trade | Foreign Tariffs",
      "shortDescription": "How much the U.S. exports of Chapter 12 oilseeds and grains — mostly soybeans — and what China, Mexico, the EU and other buyers charge on them.",
      "keywords": ["soybean export tariff", "chapter 12 tariff report", "US soybean exports to China", "oilseed export tariff", "HS 1201 export tariff"]
